============================================================
PhidgetBridge 1046 -> Modbus TCP server
============================================================
Listen        : 0.0.0.0:1502  unit/slave id 1
Word order    : float32 = big-endian, high word first (ABCD)
Addressing    : zero-based holding registers (FC 3/16)
------------------------------------------------------------
Holding registers (global):
     0  heartbeat (uint16, increments each update, wraps)
     1  status word (bit0 cal_loaded, bit1 any_over,
        bit2 any_warn, bit3 all_attached)
     2  channel count
     3  update interval (ms)
Holding registers (per channel, base = 10 + index*10):
  +0  phidget channel number
  +1  state (0 ok,1 warn,2 over | bit8 calibrated,bit9 valid)
  +2  weight float32 (2 regs)
  +4  weight int16 (rounded, signed)
  +5  capacity float32 (2 regs)
  +7  percent of capacity (tenths, 0-1000 = 0-100.0%)
Coils (FC 1/5/15):
     0+index  write 1 = tare channel (auto-cleared)
   100+index  write 1 = clear tare (auto-cleared)
------------------------------------------------------------
  index 0 -> phidget CH0: base HR 10, tare coil 0, clear coil 100
  index 1 -> phidget CH3: base HR 20, tare coil 1, clear coil 101
============================================================
(Ctrl+C to stop)
